271
00:24:01,020 --> 00:24:05,320
The Vagabur's one was the dream
event kind you've been jerking!

272
00:24:06,360 --> 00:24:07,340
That's it, bro.

273
00:24:07,660 --> 00:24:08,760
You are gonna pay!

274
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,660
Is the sonny all right?

275
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:14,000
Hold up!

276
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:17,419
Might want to check on Straw
Hat while you're at it!

277
00:24:25,980 --> 00:24:27,620
Kizaru, you bastard!

278
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:35,520
Why, I hardly recognized you, Bonnie.

279
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:36,950
My word.

280
00:24:37,460 --> 00:24:40,080
Kids these days grow up real fast.

281
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:45,220
So what's your stick in this?

282
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:48,480
Did you want to take revenge
on Vegapunk yourself?

283
00:24:49,120 --> 00:24:51,826
Are you mad we're gonna
beat you to the punch?

284
00:24:53,900 --> 00:24:54,740
Shut up.

285
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:59,341
Vegapunk isn't the one I'm
trying to kill anymore.

286
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,040
AIME Satori!

287
00:25:11,760 --> 00:25:13,525
You're not part of my mission.

288
00:25:14,660 --> 00:25:18,020
So don't make me shoot down
another acquaintance, please.

289
00:25:23,040 --> 00:25:24,320
No! The Barrier!

290
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:25,830
Bonnie!

291
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,700
Enough, Kizaru!

292
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,000
You're done for!

293
00:25:38,600 --> 00:25:39,430
Radical...

294
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,070
BASSION!

295
00:25:45,300 --> 00:25:46,130
Wait.

296
00:25:46,213 --> 00:25:47,043
He's gone?

297
00:25:47,260 --> 00:25:48,090
Kizaru!

298
00:25:48,300 --> 00:25:49,420
Where'd he go?

299
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:51,478
Stella's in danger.

300
00:25:51,780 --> 00:25:53,604
Franky, call the control room!

301
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:01,460
Yo, control room!

302
00:26:01,660 --> 00:26:03,013
Hey, Franky, you okay?

303
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:05,513
I just heard a big explosion over there!

304
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:06,560
Never mind me!

305
00:26:06,820 --> 00:26:07,879
Are you guys safe?

306
00:26:08,620 --> 00:26:09,860
Yeah? Why?

307
00:26:10,420 --> 00:26:13,260
Oh, I guess he's not
there yet. Lucky break.

308
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,169
You are making me nervous.

309
00:26:15,780 --> 00:26:16,980
It is done!

310
00:26:17,520 --> 00:26:20,520
That puny encryption was no match for us.

311
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:23,660
We're free!

312
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:25,790
We're free!

313
00:26:25,873 --> 00:26:26,703
Nice work!

314
00:26:29,460 --> 00:26:31,340
Eat that, York! You lose!

315
00:26:32,840 --> 00:26:35,400
We're so stupid pumpkin geniuses!

316
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:37,140
Hello, Franky.

317
00:26:37,560 --> 00:26:40,037
We can deactivate the
barrier any time you like.

318
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:43,177
Did you move the Vega Force One
and the ship to the back side yet?

319
00:26:43,260 --> 00:26:44,780
Nah, it's complicated.

320
00:26:47,320 --> 00:26:52,780
I hate to be the bearer of bad news,
But your escape plan is a bust.

321
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:57,800
Hello, old friend.

322
00:27:03,120 --> 00:27:04,960
Isaru! I don't know.

323
00:27:05,420 --> 00:27:06,900
When did you get here?

324
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:09,560
Wait, so what did you do to Luffy?

325
00:27:09,740 --> 00:27:11,437
You didn't kill him, did you?

326
00:27:11,520 --> 00:27:13,180
He's so dead.

327
00:27:14,260 --> 00:27:16,848
Are you the cause of
that explosion earlier?

328
00:27:17,240 --> 00:27:18,070
Uh-huh.

329
00:27:19,040 --> 00:27:19,870
Uh-huh.

330
00:27:19,953 --> 00:27:21,620
It was a bit of a tragedy.

331
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:26,200
That robot you loved
so much, I blew it up.

332
00:27:28,140 --> 00:27:28,970
What?

333
00:27:29,053 --> 00:27:30,380
How could you?

334
00:27:32,180 --> 00:27:34,440
I want you to understand something.

335
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:37,997
This mission is very difficult for me.

336
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:39,860
I'd rather not draw this out.

337
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,140
What was that?

338
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:50,960
What fresh hell is this?

339
00:27:51,140 --> 00:27:52,480
We've suffered enough!

340
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,230
Phew!

341
00:28:20,420 --> 00:28:21,380
That was spicy!

342
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,520
You're back, huh?

343
00:28:26,900 --> 00:28:28,600
So this must be...

344
00:28:30,500 --> 00:28:33,060
Guess who survived the
zappy barrier twice!

345
00:28:33,580 --> 00:28:35,817
Man, you threw me into that thing fast!

346
00:28:35,900 --> 00:28:37,429
Anyone smell burnt rubber?

347
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:50,640
Thank you.

348
00:30:13,540 --> 00:30:16,660
It's time to go to the end of the day.
